# Alembic migrations

Initialized during Sprint 0 / T005. The first revision is generated
when at least one ORM model is registered with `Base.metadata`
(Sprint 1, VS-Auth). Until then `alembic upgrade head` is a no-op
against an empty metadata, which is the intentional Sprint 0 state.

Sprint 1 will add `0001_initial.py` reflecting the 5 entities from
`specs/001-ifc-mvp-platform/data-model.md` (User, Project, ModelFile,
ConversionJob, ShareLink), without `view_count`, `metadata`, or
`expires_at` columns (R-17, R-18).
